                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A poor conversion of a great boardgame.\n\n1-No replay function in a multiplayer game\n2-Bug on history box, reported by me to the support team two month ago without any response\n3-Bug on the UNDO button, the event cards eventually played are irreparably lost\n4-No discard pile, hence I can't verify the cards already played by me/my opponent (absurd in a boardgame heavily based on cards interaction)\n5-no pausable option between CPU turns\n6-If I switch on \"cubes\" mode, the cubes are totally covered by the fort sprite (that I can't toggle off, unlike the fort name)\n7-The fist impression on AI is not good, I won my very first game 5-1 on the normal level without reading the rules\n8-The price is too high, especially in relation with the above-mentioned points\n\nI hope in a future patch because the  boardgame is interesting and it deserves a great videogame conversion; in this case I'll happily update my review",
